(Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\)) Tj
T* (IRPA Digital Board Governance System \(IRPA-DBGS\)) Tj
T* (Document status: Reverse-engineered baseline / review draft) Tj
T* (Standard structure: IEEE 29148-aligned \(requirements engineering\)) Tj
T* (Repository baseline: main at f20403e6f26c296f9d3aa3cda87588115a0f694d) Tj
T* (Inspection date: 30 October 2026) Tj
T* (Scope: Documentation only; no application, rules, production or deployment changes.) Tj
T* (Evidence convention: IMPLEMENTED = directly evidenced in inspected source; GAP = requested or expected but not found/verifiable; PROPOSED = recommended future requirement. This SRS does not claim that every source-implemented function is enabled or healthy in production.) Tj
T* (1. Introduction) Tj
T* (1.1 Purpose) Tj
T* (This SRS records the observable and source-level requirements of IRPA-DBGS so IRPA can review scope, roles, workflows, data, interfaces, quality attributes and release controls against the implementation. It is a reverse-engineered baseline, not a statement that all functions are production-ready.) Tj
T* (1.2 Scope) Tj
T* (IRPA-DBGS is a browser-first institutional governance workspace for IRPA board members, personnel, administrators, auditors and authorised operational users. The inspected source covers identity and invitations; governance and meetings; controlled documents and e-signature; authorisation/approval; finance and procurement; risk, reports and audit; research/data; grant intelligence; communications/media; IT/system administration; and installable/offline client packaging.) Tj
T* (The source includes multiple execution boundaries: React/Vite frontend; Firebase Authentication and Firestore; Firebase Functions; Cloudflare frontend Worker and Google Drive Gateway; Google Drive; SMTP; WordPress/cPanel website integration; social-provider OAuth; LiveKit meeting media; a separate grant-crawler Worker and D1 database; PWA, Electron and Capacitor Android packaging.) Tj
T* (Out of scope: redesigning the business rules; asserting legal validity of electronic signatures; inferring donor/grant submission capability; asserting operational WordPress/cPanel credentials; changing data retention policy; and making production changes.) Tj
T* (1.3 Stakeholders) Tj
T* (- IRPA Board and Board Chairperson: governance, meetings, resolutions, voting and oversight.) Tj
T* (- Executive Director and authorised approvers: institutional decisions, approvals and execution.) Tj
T* (- Secretariat / administrator: identity lifecycle, invitations, meeting coordination and records.) Tj
T* (- Department directors and personnel: departmental records, actions, reports and approvals.) Tj
T* (- Finance and procurement personnel: financial controls, procurement and payment traceability.) Tj
T* (- Communications personnel and approvers: editorial, website, social and media governance.) Tj
T* (- Research/data personnel: collection, datasets, analysis, information exchange and release readiness.) Tj
T* (- External auditors and special invitees: restricted read or meeting access.) Tj
T* (- IT/system administrators: configuration, access and release diagnostics.) Tj
T* (- Developers/maintainers: code, integrations, tests, deployment and recovery.) Tj
T* (1.4 Definitions and abbreviations) Tj
T* (- DBGS: Digital Board Governance System.) Tj
T* (- Worker/Gateway: Cloudflare server-side API boundary; the Drive Gateway is named irpa-google-drive-gateway .) Tj
T* (- Actual / Trial: data environments selected through the Data Environment Gate; identity/security collections are designated Actual-only in the data layer.) Tj
T* (- PWA: Progressive Web App.) Tj
T* (- DO: Cloudflare Durable Object; ESIGN_DO is bound for e-signature records.) Tj
T* (- KV: Cloudflare Workers KV; production gateway binding is DRIVE_KV .) Tj
T* (- D1: Cloudflare SQL database used by the isolated parallel grant crawler.) Tj
T* (- Lifecycle: controlled document state transitions, signature and archive stages.) Tj
T* (- IMPLEMENTED / GAP / PROPOSED: evidence labels defined above.) Tj
T* (1.5 Evidence and limitations) Tj
T* (The source inventory and route registrations were inspected on the repository's main baseline. The public live URL https://irpa-digital-board-governance.web.app was not accessible to the available unauthenticated inspection channel. No authenticated browser session or production diagnostic request was performed. Accordingly, runtime status, actual account-specific role assignment, provider credentials, live data, production WordPress/cPanel reachability and mobile rendering are GAP / not runtime-verified .) Tj
T* (2. Overall description) Tj
T* (2.1 Product perspective / architecture) Tj
T* (mermaid) Tj
T* (flowchart TD) Tj
T* (U[Browser / PWA / Android / Windows] -- FE[React 19 + Vite frontend]) Tj
T* (FE -- FA[Firebase Authentication]) Tj
T* (FE -- FS[Firestore + persistent local cache]) Tj
T* (FE -- CF[Cloudflare frontend Worker / static assets]) Tj
T* (FE -- GW[Google Drive Gateway Worker]) Tj
T* (GW -- FS) Tj
ET
endstream
