T* (Route coverage note: dynamic delegated routes are represented by their route families. Exact per-route authorization, payload schemas and response bodies should be maintained from the relevant router source and contract tests. The route list is not a substitute for OpenAPI.) Tj
T* (4.5 Error handling) Tj
T* (The gateway returns JSON errors with HTTP status for authentication, authorization, validation, not-found, conflict, unavailable and internal failures. Invitation redemption/password errors are normalized to safe messages; internal diagnostics redact API keys, bearer tokens, private keys and email addresses. Communications and release-readiness routes return explicit status/error information. Client UI should show loading, empty, success, offline and error states; never imply an upload, approval, signature, mail delivery or archive succeeded until the server confirms it.) Tj
